      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "- SS = PQKEM-DEC(PQPKB, CT)\n- DH1 = DH(SPKB_priv, IKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(IKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n- DH2 = DH(IKB_priv, EKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(EKA_priv, IKB_pub)\n- DH3 = DH(SPKB_priv, EKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(EKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n- SK = KDF(DH1 || DH2 || DH3 || SS)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- SS = PQKEM-DEC(PQPKB, CT)\n- DH1 = DH(SPKB_priv, IKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(IKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n- DH2 = DH(IKB_priv, EKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(EKA_priv, IKB_pub)\n- DH3 = DH(SPKB_priv, EKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(EKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n- SK = KDF(DH1 || DH2 || DH3 || SS)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "ar",
      "autoResize": true
    },
